SUMMARY:Interment with Military Honors · Patrick Cabrera
LOCATION:Tahoma National Cemetery\, Kent\, WA
DESCRIPTION:10:00 AM · Please arrive by 9:30 AM\n\nInterment means burial.
  Because Patrick served twenty years in the U.S. Army\, he will be laid to
  rest with military honors — a short ceremony by uniformed service membe
 rs that usually includes the playing of Taps and the folding of the Americ
 an flag\, which is presented to the family.\n\nThe cemetery runs on a stri
 ct military schedule and cannot hold a service for late arrivals. It is a 
 Friday morning — allow extra time for traffic and construction\, and pla
 n to leave early.
END:VEVENT
